# ============================================================
# Git attributes for the DeepSeek Harness Plugin Family
# ============================================================
#
# The generated artifacts are byte-exact build inputs: the generator writes
# them and `--check` compares their bytes. Git must not convert their line
# endings on checkout, or a clone under `core.autocrlf=true` carries CRLF
# copies, `pnpm icons:check` and `pnpm marketplace:check` fail on that clone,
# and the site's submodule publishes different bytes than the generator wrote.

Maintain/Icon/Asset/**/*.svg -text
Maintain/Icon/Ledger.json -text
marketplace.json -text
# The generated tool-catalog tables: `pnpm run catalog:check` compares their
# bytes against Maintain/Generate/Catalog's output, so a CRLF checkout would
# fail the check on every clone with core.autocrlf=true.
**/Source/Variable/Catalog.ts -text
